@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "HowToAdopt";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/user/information.css" />

<div class="static-hero">
    <h1>How to Adopt</h1>
    <p>Everything you need to know about finding and welcoming your new companion.</p>
</div>

<div class="static-body">
    <div class="steps-timeline">
        <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-number">1</div>
            <div class="step-content">
                <h3>Browse Available Pets</h3>
                <p>Visit our Adopt page to explore pets from shelters across Nepal. You can filter by species, age, gender, and location to find your perfect match. Each pet has a detailed profile with photos, health info, and temperament.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-number">2</div>
            <div class="step-content">
                <h3>Submit an Application</h3>
                <p>Found a pet you love? Click "Adopt" on their profile and fill out a short application. We'll ask about your home environment, lifestyle, and experience with pets. This helps us ensure every match is a happy one.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-number">3</div>
            <div class="step-content">
                <h3>Await Shelter Approval</h3>
                <p>Once submitted, the shelter reviews your application. This typically takes 1–3 business days. You'll receive a notification when your application status changes. You can track it anytime from your My Adoptions page.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-number">4</div>
            <div class="step-content">
                <h3>Complete the Adoption</h3>
                <p>If approved, you'll be prompted to complete the adoption by paying the adoption fee. This covers vaccination records, microchip registration, a starter kit, and a first vet visit voucher.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-number">5</div>
            <div class="step-content">
                <h3>Welcome Home</h3>
                <p>After payment, your pet will be prepared for delivery. You'll receive an Adoption Certificate with a unique ID. Prepare your home, stock up on supplies, and get ready to give your new friend a lifetime of love.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-cards">
        <div class="info-card">
            <h4>What's Included</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Complete vaccination records</li>
                <li>Microchip registration</li>
                <li>First vet visit voucher</li>
                <li>Starter pet supplies kit</li>
                <li>30 day health guarantee</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
            <h4>Good to Know</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Applications are free to submit</li>
                <li>You can apply for multiple pets</li>
                <li>Shelters set their own adoption fees</li>
                <li>You can cancel before completing payment</li>
                <li>All pets are health-checked before listing</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
            <h4>Need Help?</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Visit a shelter directly</li>
                <li>Schedule a visit from the Shelters page</li>
                <li>Check our FAQs for common questions</li>
                <li>Contact the shelter via their profile</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>